WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.950
Section tags name the parts of a page

2
00:00:03.526 --> 00:00:07.751
&lt;header&gt; is the top of the page: the title, and often the menu.

3
00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:11.477
&lt;main&gt; holds the page's main content.

4
00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:16.907
&lt;footer&gt; is the bottom: contact details and small print.

5
00:00:18.238 --> 00:00:23.588
They look like plain boxes, but their names tell screen readers what each part is.
